---
layout: base.njk
navKey: categories
pageTitle: "Categories / Kategorier"
permalink: "categories/index.html"
---
{# Was the front page until the digests took it over. The hits, grouped by beat, per desk. #}
<p class="sub">{{ categories.total }} {{ site.t.hits[0] }} across {{ categories.list | length }} {{ site.t.categories[0] | lower }}, from {{ items | length }} {{ site.t.items[0] }} ingested.
<span class="alt">{{ categories.total }} {{ site.t.hits[1] }} i {{ categories.list | length }} {{ site.t.categories[1] | lower }}, av {{ items | length }} {{ site.t.items[1] }}.</span></p>

{% if categories.total == 0 %}
  <p class="body empty">{{ site.t.noHits[0] }}<br>{{ site.t.noHits[1] }}</p>
{% endif %}

{% for desk in categories.desks %}
  <h2 class="day">{{ desk.name[0] }} / {{ desk.name[1] }} · {{ desk.count }} {{ site.t.hits[0] }}</h2>
  <ul class="browse cats">
  {% for cat in desk.categories %}
    <li><a href="{{ linkBase }}category/{{ cat.key }}/">
      <span>{{ cat.name }}</span>
      <span class="n">{{ cat.count }}</span></a></li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
{% endfor %}

<p class="sub" style="margin-top:26px">
  {{ site.t.everythingNote[0] }} <a href="{{ linkBase }}everything/">{{ site.t.everything[0] }}</a>.
  <span class="alt">{{ site.t.everythingNote[1] }} <a href="{{ linkBase }}everything/">{{ site.t.everything[1] }}</a>.</span>
</p>
